abstract: >-
  Exact rational verification software accompanying the manuscript Strict
  entropy concavity for weighted sums of four Bernoulli variables. The package
  classifies the subset-sum collision types for four arbitrary positive real
  weights, checks the analytic entropy-loss identities and finite comparisons
  for the sharp bound, and verifies a separate rational interval curvature certificate.
